Z||000086||Motorhead||07-01-2000||07:46 AM||||After reading through all these posts again, several things come to mind.  WHY NOT (PERIOD).  Since I've joined this forum I've always wondered Who all you folks are!  What draws us all together.  Who in there right mind would be so devoted to an automobile that they would drive half way across the country to meet other people who are as nuts as they are?  The answer is:  I would!<BR>This isn't about who has to drive the farthest.  It's about who else is as crazy as I am.<BR>I'll be there even if it's on the west coast, if for no other reason than to see who else is as crazy as me!<BR>Just schedule it for NEXT summer if it's gonna be more than a weeks commitment!<BR>I got no vacation time left!!!<BR>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
